(7337698, 1145323, 150277, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite of the challenge. Admittedly it maybe was selling something, but I thought this was like a picture of a family on the beach. And had I wanted to purchase a photo of two people slightly disgusted by something, this was perfect. And so unique I thought. I loved the expressions and the setting.</td>', 'This was my favorite of the challenge. Admittedly it maybe was selling something, but I thought this was like a picture of a family on the beach. And had I wanted to purchase a photo of two people slightly disgusted by something, this was perfect. And so unique I thought. I loved the expressions and the setting.', '2015-04-05 00:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
