(7337701, 1145180, 150277, '<td valign="top">I think I struggled a bit with this image because I did not know what this tool was and the angle seemed awkward for something that applied makeup.  Or maybe the background (which admittedly pretty) if it had been starker white would have helped me isolate the tool and the tool would have stood out more.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-04-04 23:47:35.</i></td>', 'I think I struggled a bit with this image because I did not know what this tool was and the angle seemed awkward for something that applied makeup.  Or maybe the background (which admittedly pretty) if it had been starker white would have helped me isolate the tool and the tool would have stood out more.', '2015-04-05 00:45:13.000000', '2015-04-05 00:47:35.000000', 0),
